OL,3,AG7 to release up to 100 million barrels
OL,4,Aof diesel and crude oil in bid to stop
OL,5,Asoaring prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeaders from the G7 bloc of advanced
OL,8,Feconomies have agreed to work "in a
OL,9,Fcoordinated manner" to help bring down
OL,10,Fdiesel prices
OL,12,FThey will make production "more
OL,13,Fflexible", release strategic reserves
OL,14,Fof "up to 100 million barrels" within
OL,15,Ffour months, and avoid energy
OL,16,Frestrictions between partner countries
OL,18,FThe meeting comes after President
OL,19,FDonald Trump threatened to ban diesel
OL,20,Fexports - to bring US prices down -
OL,21,Funless Europe agreed to release its
OL,22,Freserves
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
